    "description": "<p>The Abyssal's sense of smell becomes as precise and unerring as death itself, and her taste carries the cold analytical certainty of entropy. She can identify every individual within a wide radius by scent, detect any poison or disease instantaneously, and follow tracks by scent even across water or through crowds. The Obvious quality manifests as a faint sweet-rot smell that clings to the Abyssal while this Charm is active. She adds her Essence in bonus dice to all Awareness rolls involving smell or taste.</p>",
